### Admin Paneline Erişim Denemesi (ROLE_USER ile)
GET http://localhost:5353/api/admin/projects HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
# Cookie'ler otomatik gidecek

### Admin Paneline Erişim Denemesi (ROLE_ADMIN ile)
GET http://localhost:5353/api/admin/projects HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
# Cookie'ler otomatik gidecek

### refresh token ile yeni access token alma
POST {{url}}/refresh HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
# Cookie'ler otomatik gidecek

### signout
POST {{url}}/signout HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

### analytics
POST http://localhost:5353/api/analytics/visit HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
